  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      47.97,
      285.22,
      283.98,
      296.29
    ],
    "text": "The matter in dispute between the aforesaid parties is \u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      47.97,
      305.22,
      542.49,
      328.29
    ],
    "text": "Whether Mr. A. M. S. M. P. S. Attanayaka working in Lanka Sugar Company (Private) Limited who had been interdicted on 05.03.2021 had been caused injustice when he was reinstated in employment on 03.05.2022 by,",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      47.97,
      338.22,
      520.23,
      397.29
    ],
    "text": "(i) being degraded from the post of Foreman to the post of Electrician, (ii) the salary increments for 2022/2023/2024 being deferred, (iii) non - payment of Salaries for the period of interdiction, (iv) internal transfer and (v) not being issued a copy of the \ufb01 nal report of the formal disciplinary inquiry conducted by the institution,",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      47.97,
      407.22,
      528.95,
      454.29
    ],
    "text": "and if such injustice had been caused, to what relief he is entitled. H. K. K. A. J\u0d7a\u0d92\u0d7a\u0d8c\u0d8e\u0d87\u0d7d\u0d7a\u0d8b\u0d7a, Commissioner General of Labour (Acting)",
